{"id":"zh-Hant-001","text":"媽，妳把我的雨衣藏哪兒了？","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-002","text":"結界裡的月亮怎麼是方的？","categories":["anime-drama","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-003","text":"別擱這兒吵，孩子剛睡。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-004","text":"梁以安老師還在改考卷。","categories":["names","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-005","text":"龍睡醒以前，別碰那顆蛋。","categories":["anime-drama","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-006","text":"末班車只剩兩個座位。","categories":["numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-007","text":"我跟你鬧著玩兒呢。","categories":["colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-008","text":"別再畫蛇添足，圖已經夠花了。","categories":["idioms","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-009","text":"總得有人留下來照顧那隻鹿。","categories":["anime-drama","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-010","text":"這個 bug 也太會躲了吧。","categories":["mixed-latin","code-switching","internet-slang","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-011","text":"你來回走走，鞋才不會磨腳。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-012","text":"把三張符紙壓在石頭底下。","categories":["anime-drama","numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-013","text":"大夥兒都等著你開飯呢。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-014","text":"周念禾醫師說傷口沒事。","categories":["names","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-015","text":"你都沒聽完，急什麼嘛。","categories":["casual-speech","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-016","text":"這不是神操作，是誤打誤撞。","categories":["internet-slang","idioms"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-017","text":"我尋思著，咱倆換個位置？","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-018","text":"導覽約在12:30開始。","categories":["numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-019","text":"爸，我不是不想回家吃飯，只是今天臨時多了一場會議，等我把最後一份報告寄出去，就搭車回去，你們千萬別餓著肚子等我，好嗎？","categories":["long-lines","casual-speech","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-020","text":"先別按 Enter，咒語還沒寫完。","categories":["anime-drama","mixed-latin","code-switching"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-021","text":"哪有人拿鍋蓋當盾牌的啦。","categories":["casual-speech","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-022","text":"陳序白同學借了四本書。","categories":["names","numbers-counters","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-023","text":"讓我聞一聞，這牛奶怪怪的。","categories":["colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-024","text":"他那句留言真的很破防。","categories":["internet-slang"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-025","text":"這顆星星摸起來竟然是熱的。","categories":["anime-drama","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-026","text":"別因小失大，先救船上的人。","categories":["anime-drama","idioms"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-027","text":"那朵花一開，影子就站起來了。","categories":["anime-drama","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-028","text":"我的 Wi-Fi 又斷線了。","categories":["mixed-latin","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-029","text":"這張梗圖我昨天才存過。","categories":["internet-slang","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-030","text":"總共3.5公斤，別全塞給我。","categories":["numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-031","text":"咱們找個地兒躲雨吧。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-032","text":"沈青嵐隊長不接受這個命令。","categories":["anime-drama","names"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-033","text":"門開著，卻沒有任何腳步聲。","categories":["anime-drama","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-034","text":"你這回覆根本是大型翻車現場。","categories":["internet-slang"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-035","text":"先收拾收拾，客人快到了。","categories":["colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-036","text":"靠這一招就想一石二鳥？","categories":["anime-drama","idioms","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-037","text":"你還留著她寫的便條啊。","categories":["suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-038","text":"今晚的 demo 換你主持。","categories":["mixed-latin","code-switching"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-039","text":"這把劍連紙都切不開。","categories":["anime-drama","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-040","text":"你看，山谷那頭的燈還亮著，守門人一定沒有離開；我們先沿著河岸慢慢走，別驚動樹上的鳥，等霧散了再決定要不要穿過吊橋。","categories":["long-lines","anime-drama","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-041","text":"妳甭替我操心，湯我會熱。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-042","text":"許知澄小姐的車停在後門。","categories":["names"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-043","text":"把錯字圈出來，再輕輕地擦掉。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-044","text":"這份履歷也太斜槓了吧。","categories":["internet-slang","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-045","text":"我來過這裡，可是想不起路了。","categories":["suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-046","text":"別把當機說成天意，這是自欺欺人。","categories":["idioms"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-047","text":"你倆嘀咕什麼呢？","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-048","text":"我把 backup 放在另一顆硬碟。","categories":["mixed-latin","code-switching","numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-049","text":"這會兒哪有船肯載我們？","categories":["anime-drama","colloquial-contractions","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-050","text":"六位乘客都得重新驗票。","categories":["numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-051","text":"弟弟吃著吃著就睡著了。","categories":["colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-052","text":"顧星橋教授正在等電梯。","categories":["names"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-053","text":"冰箱空空的，你還問晚餐呢。","categories":["casual-speech","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-054","text":"妹妹偷偷地把甜椒挑出來。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-055","text":"別忙活了，坐下歇會兒。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-056","text":"既然箭在弦上，就別回頭看。","categories":["anime-drama","idioms"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-057","text":"我聽懂了，不代表我同意喔。","categories":["suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-058","text":"請把 PDF 裡的日期改成11月9日。","categories":["mixed-latin","numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-059","text":"老師，我知道這份作業晚交了，可是我不想把網路斷線當成藉口；我已經重新整理過資料，也把引用的地方標清楚，您願意再看一遍嗎？","categories":["long-lines","casual-speech","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-060","text":"餅乾一袋八十元，零錢找好了。","categories":["numbers-counters","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-061","text":"這門怎麼推也推不開呀。","categories":["suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-062","text":"羅予晴學姐說別跟丟了。","categories":["names","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-063","text":"你慢慢說，我沒有要掛電話。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-064","text":"你這個吃瓜群也太熱鬧。","categories":["internet-slang"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-065","text":"書店離這兒不到五百公尺。","categories":["colloquial-contractions","numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-066","text":"現在逞強，只會兩敗俱傷。","categories":["anime-drama","idioms"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-067","text":"她把窗簾拉得緊緊的。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-068","text":"你有沒有收到我的 invite？","categories":["mixed-latin","code-switching","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-069","text":"還有半杯豆漿，誰要喝？","categories":["casual-speech","numbers-counters","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-070","text":"你先把 USB-C 接頭拔掉。","categories":["mixed-latin","code-switching","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-071","text":"你把話說完了再走嘛。","categories":["casual-speech","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-072","text":"方語舟師傅只收現金。","categories":["names"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-073","text":"我就納悶兒，鑰匙怎麼會在米缸？","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-074","text":"這次不是社死，是全村都知道了。","categories":["internet-slang","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-075","text":"你摸一摸，這布料很扎手。","categories":["colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-076","text":"他只是狐假虎威，根本沒兵。","categories":["anime-drama","idioms"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-077","text":"別默默地忍著，我看得出來。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-078","text":"這組 API key 不能貼到群裡。","categories":["mixed-latin","code-switching"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-079","text":"八點前能送到兩箱礦泉水嗎？","categories":["numbers-counters","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-080","text":"船長，羅盤一直指著廚房，未必是壞了，也可能是那位廚師把磁石藏在鍋底；你先讓大家退到甲板上，我留下來問問他，千萬別急著拔刀。","categories":["long-lines","anime-drama","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-081","text":"這回我可沒跟你開玩笑。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-082","text":"唐未央主任把燈全關了。","categories":["names","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-083","text":"她說話輕輕的，我聽不清。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-084","text":"沒想到你才是真正的隱藏大佬。","categories":["internet-slang"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-085","text":"讓孩子們自個兒商量吧。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-086","text":"臨時抱佛腳，也比直接放棄好。","categories":["idioms"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-087","text":"我找到的是空盒子，不是戒指。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-088","text":"你在群組說 OK 就算答應了。","categories":["mixed-latin","code-switching","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-089","text":"旅館每晚加收10%的清潔費。","categories":["numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-090","text":"石像剛才真的眨眼了嗎？","categories":["anime-drama","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-091","text":"吃點兒酸的，胃可能舒服些。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-092","text":"江映竹導演要大家再走一遍。","categories":["names","numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-093","text":"你得承認，這主意挺了不起。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-094","text":"這留言區怎麼突然開始內捲？","categories":["internet-slang","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-095","text":"先抱抱，別的等會兒再說。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-096","text":"這樣借花獻佛，你倒挺省事。","categories":["idioms"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-097","text":"我盯著螢幕，卻什麼也沒看見。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-098","text":"請用 offline 模式開地圖。","categories":["mixed-latin","code-switching"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-099","text":"你不用把每一件事都做得十全十美，我今天來找你，只是想一起去河邊走走，聽你說說這陣子的煩惱，不是來檢查你的人生到底及不及格。","categories":["long-lines","casual-speech","idioms","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-100","text":"第七層樓只有一盞燈亮著。","categories":["numbers-counters","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-101","text":"杜明川先生，您的護照掉了。","categories":["names","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-102","text":"這碗麵得趁熱吃呀。","categories":["casual-speech","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-103","text":"這種反向帶貨我還是頭一次見。","categories":["internet-slang"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-104","text":"妳寫的字比我的整齊多了。","categories":["suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-105","text":"小點兒聲，牆後頭有人。","categories":["anime-drama","colloquial-contractions"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-106","text":"奶奶笑得眼睛都瞇起來了。","categories":["suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-107","text":"咱仨輪著顧攤，誰也別逞強。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-108","text":"我看不懂這張轉乘圖。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-109","text":"請在2.8公尺外畫一道線。","categories":["numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-110","text":"我等過，也恨過，現在只想走。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-111","text":"程若溪把最後一票投給了我。","categories":["names","numbers-counters","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-112","text":"我只想安安靜靜地吃頓飯。","categories":["casual-speech","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-113","text":"他連道歉都要蹭熱度。","categories":["internet-slang"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-114","text":"你能不能把語速放慢一點兒？","categories":["colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-115","text":"這麼著吧，你守門，我找燈。","categories":["anime-drama","colloquial-contractions","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-116","text":"你找得到那家修鞋店嗎？","categories":["suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-117","text":"別本末倒置，先讓病人休息。","categories":["idioms"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-118","text":"你瞧瞧，麵團都發起來了。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-119","text":"兩打雞蛋怎麼只剩十一顆？","categories":["numbers-counters","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-120","text":"整座車站只剩下我們和那個背著木箱的人，他一直盯著已經停掉的時鐘，嘴裡卻說下一班車快到了；我覺得不太對勁，你先別把車票交給他。","categories":["long-lines","anime-drama","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-121","text":"鄭望舒校長也搭這班公車。","categories":["names"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-122","text":"我沒轍了，你幫我想想。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-123","text":"原來你早就把我設成特別關心。","categories":["internet-slang"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-124","text":"他了解我的目的，不必再解釋。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-125","text":"再熬會兒，藥香就出來了。","categories":["anime-drama","colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-126","text":"有啥話進屋說，外頭風大。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-127","text":"你這樣查資料，無異於緣木求魚。","categories":["idioms"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-128","text":"她把信折得小小的，藏進口袋。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-129","text":"七十五分鐘夠你轉機嗎？","categories":["numbers-counters","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-130","text":"別光看著呀，過來搭把手。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-131","text":"葉清和護士認得那枚胸針。","categories":["names","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-132","text":"咱一塊兒去買菜，順便散步。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-133","text":"這個濾鏡把爸爸變成美食博主。","categories":["internet-slang"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-134","text":"我說得很清楚，你別裝沒聽見。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-135","text":"幫我把這段做成 GIF 吧。","categories":["mixed-latin","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-136","text":"這份 design review 我不參加。","categories":["mixed-latin","code-switching"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-137","text":"你的證據都對不上，別張冠李戴。","categories":["idioms","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-138","text":"你先轉轉手腕，別直接搬重的。","categories":["colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-139","text":"廚房那鍋不是給客人的，是我試了好幾次才煮出來的湯；你要是覺得太鹹就直說，別為了怕我難過，硬把整碗喝光，我真的不會生氣。","categories":["long-lines","casual-speech","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-140","text":"我打開窗，才發現雪下了一夜。","categories":["suffix-chains","numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-141","text":"潘予衡警官要我保留那張收據。","categories":["names"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-142","text":"你咋又把襪子塞到沙發底下？","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-143","text":"別刷存在感，先把水龍頭關好。","categories":["internet-slang","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-144","text":"她只是笑了笑，沒有接那束花。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-145","text":"別把 deleted 當成已經備份。","categories":["mixed-latin","code-switching"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-146","text":"你們聊你們的，我去遛個彎兒。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-147","text":"再添預算也是杯水車薪。","categories":["idioms"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-148","text":"這道鎖我解得開，詛咒可不行。","categories":["anime-drama","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-149","text":"一共九十三頁，背面也要印。","categories":["numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-150","text":"幹嘛突然客氣起來，怪嚇人的。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-151","text":"溫知夏編的曲子，你聽過吧？","categories":["names","suffix-chains","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-152","text":"這事兒甭提了，先吃蛋糕。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-153","text":"我只是潛水，沒有退出群組。","categories":["internet-slang"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-154","text":"他慢慢地鬆手，戒指掉進了河裡。","categories":["suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-155","text":"你說的 hotfix 到底修了哪裡？","categories":["mixed-latin","code-switching","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-156","text":"再磨蹭會兒，市場就關門了。","categories":["casual-speech","colloquial-contractions","particles"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-157","text":"這叫亡羊補牢，不叫假裝沒事。","categories":["idioms"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-158","text":"把法杖拿穩，別晃來晃去。","categories":["anime-drama","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-159","text":"今天限量三十份，不能多買。","categories":["numbers-counters"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-160","text":"主管，我願意把出錯的部分重做，但不願意在沒看過資料的情況下簽名；如果這份表明天就要送出，我們今晚應該先把每一項數字核對清楚。","categories":["long-lines","casual-speech","suffix-chains"]}
{"id":"zh-Hant-161","text":"賀行遠教練在操場等你。","categories":["names"]}
